    "sections" : [
      {
        "executes" : true,
        "heading" : "When to invoke",
        "line" : 20,
        "lines" : [
          "\"backfill dataset partitions\"",
          "\"run partition backfill\"",
          "\"run the backfill pass\""
        ],
        "role" : "applicability"
      },
      {
        "executes" : true,
        "heading" : "Workflow",
        "line" : 25,
        "lines" : [
          "fetch datasets",
          "for each dataset:",
          "fetch partitions for the dataset",
          "let oldest partitions be the first 5 partitions sorted by updated at descending",
          "simultaneously:",
          "for each partition:",
          "backfill the partition",
          "in the background, run quality checks on the dataset",
          "Emit: \"partition backfill pass complete\""
        ],
        "role" : "procedure"
      },
      {
        "executes" : false,
        "heading" : "Anti-Patterns",
        "line" : 36,
        "lines" : [
          "Don't widen the backfill window past the oldest five partitions on a",
          "whim. A larger batch is a longer-running simultaneous block, which",
          "competes harder with whatever else the pipeline needs to do at the same",
          "time",
          "Don't wait for the background quality check to finish before reporting",
          "the backfill as complete — it runs in the background precisely so it",
          "doesn't gate this skill's own completion"
        ],
        "role" : "reference"
      },
      {
        "executes" : false,
        "heading" : "Report shape",
        "line" : 45,
        "lines" : [
          "The receipt calls out the oldest partitions selected for backfill per",
          "dataset, so an engineer can confirm the right window was chosen without",
          "re-running the sort themselves"
        ],
        "role" : "template"
      }
    ],
    "triggers" : "\"backfill dataset partitions\"\n\"run partition backfill\"\n\"run the backfill pass\""
  },
